BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (The highest-value control is knowing when enforcement must stop. Under 11 U.S.C. ? 362, a bankruptcy filing can stay) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (enforcement against the debtor or estate property; exceptions and relief require actual legal analysis. Check PACER) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (before material collection steps and escalate filing notices immediately rather than waiting for the weekly portfolio) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (review. Bankruptcy can also create recovery or return exposure for transfers under provisions such as 11 U.S.C. ? 547;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (counsel should assess timing, parties, and defenses before the operator treats proceeds as irreversible. Exemptions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (require similarly specific analysis. Federal limits under 15 U.S.C. ? 1673 can restrict garnishment of an individual's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (disposable earnings, while state law may provide greater protection. A commercial origin does not erase exemptions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (applicable to the property or person pursued. Real-property judgment liens depend on the relevant recording and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (attachment rules, including California Code of Civil Procedure ? 697.310 where applicable. For personal property,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (UCC priority analysis can determine whether a lien creditor is subordinate to a secured party. Obtain a dated priority) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (worksheet and an estimated net-realization range before spending on execution. Publicly visible ownership without) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (reachable equity is a research result, not a collection plan.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (Lawful data access is part of the production system, not a purchase-order footnote. Use public court records, authorized) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (client documents, properly obtained discovery, and vendors whose access conditions fit the matter. LexisNexis) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (Accurint or TransUnion TLOxp access, where available, carries contractual and use restrictions; a subscription does not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (authorize every search or downstream disclosure. For consumer reports, document an applicable permissible purpose) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (under 15 U.S.C. ? 1681b rather than assuming that holding any judgment grants unrestricted access. Avoid pretexting,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (credential sharing, and access to another person's private accounts. Store only evidence needed for the mandate, restrict) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (exports, log access, and define retention and deletion schedules. Automate court deadline tracking and payment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (reconciliation, the two canonical leverage points, while keeping independent review for calculated dates, identity) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (matches, interest adjustments, and satisfaction filings. A calendar should retain the triggering event, jurisdiction, rule) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (source, reviewer, and reminder history; a payment workflow should retain bank evidence, allocation logic, and) Tj ET
