BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (than manual work. Measure exception age and correction rate alongside throughput so automation earns trust through) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (observed accuracy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.37 Tm (A small team becomes durable when it repeatedly rejects attractive-looking but uncollectible files and closes the loop) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.15 Tm (on accepted ones. Give the owner responsibility for intake economics, client authority, and expenditure decisions;) Tj ET
